{
  "case_id": "2010-09-1343",
  "document_hash": "11f5071d15852440c54896533a34972da52628da1d4bb607bbcb625ef304ade2",
  "records": [
    {
      "attribution": "Arthur F. Fergenson, Esq., on behalf of Petitioner",
      "case_id": "2010-09-1343",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "11f5071d15852440c54896533a34972da52628da1d4bb607bbcb625ef304ade2",
      "evidence_id": "ev-11f5071d1585-0000-0001",
      "kind": "party_argument",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 3,
        "start": 3
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "Because J. McIntyre did not direct any activity at residents of New Jersey either itself or by directing its distributor MMA to do so and had no awareness or knowledge that the distributor took the action that it did toward New Jersey, New Jersey lacked adjudicative jurisdiction."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Justice Scalia",
      "case_id": "2010-09-1343",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "11f5071d15852440c54896533a34972da52628da1d4bb607bbcb625ef304ade2",
      "evidence_id": "ev-11f5071d1585-0000-0002",
      "kind": "justice_question",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 3,
        "start": 3
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "When you say \"its distributor,\" was this distributor at all controlled by the defendant?"
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Arthur F. Fergenson, Esq., on behalf of Petitioner",
      "case_id": "2010-09-1343",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "11f5071d15852440c54896533a34972da52628da1d4bb607bbcb625ef304ade2",
      "evidence_id": "ev-11f5071d1585-0000-0003",
      "kind": "party_argument",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 5,
        "start": 5
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "It wanted to sell its product anywhere that the distributor could find. The distributor was the market manager."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Justice Sotomayor",
      "case_id": "2010-09-1343",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "11f5071d15852440c54896533a34972da52628da1d4bb607bbcb625ef304ade2",
      "evidence_id": "ev-11f5071d1585-0001-0000",
      "kind": "justice_question",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 21,
        "start": 21
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "You did travel to certain of the trade shows -\u00ad"
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Justice Breyer",
      "case_id": "2010-09-1343",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "11f5071d15852440c54896533a34972da52628da1d4bb607bbcb625ef304ade2",
      "evidence_id": "ev-11f5071d1585-0001-0001",
      "kind": "justice_question",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 22,
        "start": 22
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "Now, first, the word \"distributor\" hurts you, so I'm going to take that out, and I imagine a hypothetical -- I know your case differs from that, but I'm going to ask them how it differs, not you, okay?"
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Mr. FerGenson (Respondent)",
      "case_id": "2010-09-1343",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "11f5071d15852440c54896533a34972da52628da1d4bb607bbcb625ef304ade2",
      "evidence_id": "ev-11f5071d1585-0001-0002",
      "kind": "party_argument",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 24,
        "start": 24
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "I believe that that conflicts, Your Honor, with Asahi."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Mr. Ross (Respondent)",
      "case_id": "2010-09-1343",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "11f5071d15852440c54896533a34972da52628da1d4bb607bbcb625ef304ade2",
      "evidence_id": "ev-11f5071d1585-0001-0003",
      "kind": "party_argument",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 26,
        "start": 26
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "All we wish to do is sell our products in the States and get paid."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Justice Alito",
      "case_id": "2010-09-1343",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "11f5071d15852440c54896533a34972da52628da1d4bb607bbcb625ef304ade2",
      "evidence_id": "ev-11f5071d1585-0001-0005",
      "kind": "justice_question",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 37,
        "start": 37
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "What -- what difference does attending some trade shows in the United States mean -\u00ad make?"
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Justice KAGAN",
      "case_id": "2010-09-1343",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "11f5071d15852440c54896533a34972da52628da1d4bb607bbcb625ef304ade2",
      "evidence_id": "ev-11f5071d1585-0002-0000",
      "kind": "justice_question",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 40,
        "start": 40
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "And, Mr. Ross, isn't the point that he was selling by using large convention sites in the United States, expecting that people from other States would show up to those large convention sites?"
    },
    {
      "attribution": "MR. ROSS",
      "case_id": "2010-09-1343",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "11f5071d15852440c54896533a34972da52628da1d4bb607bbcb625ef304ade2",
      "evidence_id": "ev-11f5071d1585-0002-0001",
      "kind": "fact",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 41,
        "start": 41
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "That's the marketing system that's used for these massive machines that they're trying to sell nationwide."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "MR. ROSS",
      "case_id": "2010-09-1343",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "11f5071d15852440c54896533a34972da52628da1d4bb607bbcb625ef304ade2",
      "evidence_id": "ev-11f5071d1585-0002-0002",
      "kind": "party_argument",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 44,
        "start": 44
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "If there is purposeful availment of entering a market and you sell the product into that market, you take these additional steps plus the intent, plus the additional -"
    },
    {
      "attribution": "States' amicus brief",
      "case_id": "2010-09-1343",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "11f5071d15852440c54896533a34972da52628da1d4bb607bbcb625ef304ade2",
      "evidence_id": "ev-11f5071d1585-0002-0003",
      "kind": "amicus_argument",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 59,
        "start": 59
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "Ignorance of the fact that New Jersey is a State within our union, or of the specifics of New Jersey products liability law, should not allow Petitioner to avoid jurisdiction. Its own lack of research prior to embarking on a nationwide marketing campaign is no defense."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Justice Sotomayor",
      "case_id": "2010-09-1343",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "11f5071d15852440c54896533a34972da52628da1d4bb607bbcb625ef304ade2",
      "evidence_id": "ev-11f5071d1585-0003-0000",
      "kind": "justice_question",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 60,
        "start": 60
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "JUSTICE SOTOMAYOR: It's a point that your adversary raised in passing. I'm not quite sure, do you sell outright to the American company? Do you ship a product and they pay you, or they only pay you when they receive the money from their customer? There appears to be some suggestion of the latter."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Source extraction",
      "case_id": "2010-09-1343",
      "confidence": 0.0,
      "document_hash": "11f5071d15852440c54896533a34972da52628da1d4bb607bbcb625ef304ade2",
